# Static files in this directory are served as-is and never hit the SPA
# fallback: /favicon.ico /favicon.svg /apple-touch-icon.png /icon-192.png
# /icon-512.png /icon-maskable-512.png /book/ and any other real file.
#
# Do not rewrite a no-slash marketing path to /index.html. Pages pretty-URLs
# treat that destination as the root document and 308s it to `/`, so
# /services /about /apply all land on the homepage. The trailing-slash
# forms already 200 with the SPA shell; send the no-slash forms there.
#
# Unknown paths that are not a real file get the SPA shell as 404 so the
# client can render NotFound instead of looking like a successful home load.

/services       /services/       308
/work           /work/           308
/about          /about/          308
/apply          /apply/          308
/privacy        /privacy/        308
/terms          /terms/          308
/refund-policy  /refund-policy/  308

/services/       /index.html   200
/work/           /index.html   200
/about/          /index.html   200
/apply/          /index.html   200
/privacy/        /index.html   200
/terms/          /index.html   200
/refund-policy/  /index.html   200

/*            /index.html   404
